  "design_notes": "The LAMP trial was a multicenter, controlled, prospective, randomized, open-label, blinded end point trial conducted at 27 hospitals in China. Patients were randomized 1:1. Both groups received standard treatment according to the guidelines. Follow-up was 90 days. Study enrollment was terminated early because of lower-than-expected enrollment and financial limitations.",
